# Registry & UI

Source: `packages/ui/src/`. Short `@/` imports (shadcn rewrites them on install). Item manifests: `packages/ui/scripts/registry-items.ts`. Do not hand-edit `packages/ui/registry.json` or `packages/ui/src/components/ui/`.

Own UI under `components/dimah-s3/`, `hooks/`, and `lib/`. Never `lib/attachment.ts` (basename collision with stock Attachment). Colors: `*-dimah-s3-*`, not bare `bg-primary`. Logical CSS (`text-start`, `ms-*`, `ps-*`, `start-*`) unless the physical side is required.

After item or file-list changes: `pnpm registry:validate`, commit `packages/ui/registry.json` if it changed.

**When adding or changing a component or registry item, Read** [docs/agents/registry.md](docs/agents/registry.md). For a local fix, match the surrounding code.
